# The annotations of screen/screen (kit/mkgame.py --part src/screen/screen.json). Format: ../../../../docs/ann-format.md.

@module screen ; The loading screen
@about Tape block 5: a headerless block of 6912 bytes that LoaderMain ($5E00, src/loader) loads at $4000 with the ROM's LD-BYTES. It stays on the screen through the game's load; Menu $9723 wipes it (MenuWipe $984D, ClearScreen $992F) when the game starts.
$4000 b LoadingScreen 32 ; The loading screen: 6144 bytes of pixels, 768 of attributes
> Witness: c1 loads it at $4000 between the loader's start (frame 1094) and the game's entry (frame 15 019) at ROM speed; src/res/screens/loading.png and loading-attr.csv are the picture.
@res screens/loading.bin
